00:06:08.596 --> 00:06:11.860
<v Host>So there may be fewer sunny winter days than usual.

00:06:12.459 --> 00:06:20.139
<v Slow>ただ、この冬は、気温が大きく変わる可能性があります。

00:06:20.939 --> 00:06:25.115
<v Host>However, temperatures may go up and down a lot this winter.

00:06:25.716 --> 00:06:37.475
